---@field tpmVersionInfo? gcp.unstable.admin_directory_v1.ChromeOsDeviceTpmVersionInfo Trusted Platform Module (TPM) (Read-only)
---@field orderNumber? string The device's order number. Only devices directly purchased from Google have an order number.
