---Information regarding a command that was issued to a device.
---@class gcp.unstable.admin_directory_v1.DirectoryChromeosdevicesCommand
---@field commandResult? gcp.unstable.admin_directory_v1.DirectoryChromeosdevicesCommandResult The result of the command execution.
---@field commandExpireTime? string The time at which the command will expire. If the device doesn't execute the command within this time the command will become expired.
---@field payload? string The payload that the command specified, if any.
---@field issueTime? string The timestamp when the command was issued by the admin.
---@field type? gcp.unstable.admin_directory_v1.DirectoryChromeosdevicesCommandTypeEnum The type of the command.
