---@field manufacturer? string Mobile Device manufacturer (Read-only)
---@field supportsWorkProfile? boolean Work profile supported on device (Read-only)
---@field otherAccountsInfo? gcp.unstable.admin_directory_v1.StringList The list of accounts added on device (Read-only)
---@field defaultLanguage? string The default locale used on the device.
---@field brand? string Mobile Device Brand (Read-only)
