---@field bootloaderVersion? string Mobile Device Bootloader version (Read-only)
---@field lastSync? string Date and time the device was last synchronized with the policy settings in the G Suite administrator control panel (Read-only)
---@field privilege? string DMAgentPermission (Read-only)
---@field adbStatus? boolean Adb (USB debugging) enabled or disabled on device (Read-only)
---@field securityPatchLevel? string Mobile Device Security patch level (Read-only)

