---@field floorNames? gcp.unstable.admin_directory_v1.StringList The display names for all floors in this building. The floors are expected to be sorted in ascending order, from lowest floor to highest floor. For example, ["B2", "B1", "L", "1", "2", "2M", "3", "PH"] Must contain at least one entry.
---@field kind? string Kind of resource this is.
