---@field address? gcp.unstable.admin_directory_v1.BuildingAddress The postal address of the building. See [`PostalAddress`](/my-business/reference/rest/v4/PostalAddress) for details. Note that only a single address line and region code are required.
---@field etags? string ETag of the resource.
